              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Trade? (commercium, commerciī.) To do business? (negōtior, negōtiārī.) Market day? (nūndinae, nūndinārum.) Harbour dues? (portōrium, portōriī.) To gain? (lucror, lucrārī.) Riches? (dīvitiae, dīvitiārum.) To be in need? (egeō, egēre.) Want? (egestās, egestātis.) To be without? (careō, carēre.) To have plenty? (abundō, abundāre.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
